From 6003f77340d7f6ad702d25b1dacb6d9554c6f774 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
Date: Mon, 05 Oct 2026 11:28:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] LatinIME: Add floating keyboard mode

Like Gboard, allow detaching the keyboard into a smaller floating panel
that can be dragged anywhere on screen, leaving the app underneath
unresized. A key in the suggestion strip floats or docks the keyboard,
the panel position is remembered per orientation, and dragging it to
the bottom edge docks it again.

The floating panel uses the phone layouts at a phone-like size and is
never split.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Ie5a900c6284821043740644fa0b0efcdcb5677d4
Signed-off-by: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
---

